{
  "label": "yumispring6",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label yumispring6:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday1.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And when the morning comes, don’t wake. Stay closed, oh tired eyes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "With distance still and bones to break, the shape of our demise-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Shall mold the neon hearts we share, remind us who we are.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Survivors in a dying world. Two strangers in two cars.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday2.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Mildew again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Familiar, but not.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now masked by the smoke-tendril arms of cheap scented candles, this is nothing like the floor of an old, lived-in apartment.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This is a place where people come to forget under the pretense of making memories. And it is somewhere you never thought you’d see come the morning after.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tell me, Friend — what did you dream of last night?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday3.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ignore me all you like. It does not change the fact that I grow within you like that dragon grows in her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei?...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": .........",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How comfortable it must be — to have the arms you’ve always dreamt of plunged deep in the stomach of your nightmares — draped over you like the curtains you plucked from the side of the road just last month.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "They smell of mildew too, I’m sure. You haven’t learned how to get rid of it yet. And that’s just one of the many things you likely won’t ever learn if you stay where you are now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday4.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Would you like to go back, Yumi?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Because you can.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "All you need to do is make a wish.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She lightly removes the arm of the man who comforted her last night, placing it gently by his side as she seizes a very rare opportunity to get a look at his face while he can’t see hers.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday5.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Her gaze lingers on his eyes — closed and moving rapidly behind his eyelids like the sockets are full of worker ants. Like his body is their underground lair.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She thinks about removing his glasses. She didn’t want him to risk breaking them if he rolled over now that he wasn’t anchored to her body.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She doesn’t, though.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She just stares at him. Half thankful. Half cherished. Two halves that were entirely unfamiliar to her, yet combined to create something or somewhere that just felt right.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But one good thing in a sea of bad things can not offset that ever-encroaching darkness. And while these halves were good ones, there were two others that always dragged her down.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "They followed her everywhere. They determined everything about her life. Yet, she was afraid to leave them behind because she was unsure of what else she might find.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She decides to keep staring..",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ......Yumi?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He decides to wake up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What time is it?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can go back to sleep, though. It’s fine.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you going to do?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday6.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have to get ready for school.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I imagine it’s still pretty early since I can’t hear anybody fucking anymore.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday7.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": School? Are you kidding? Take the day off. You’ve never had a better reason to skip than this.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, that’s exactly why I ain’t doin’ it this time.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Explain?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday8.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The fuck do you think is gonna happen if I just do my own thing again all day?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Question ain’t for you to answer, numbnuts. It’s one of those rhetorical ones or whatever they’re called.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I stay here, I’ll wind up beatin’ myself up until I feel even fuckin’ worse. And you saw me last night. This shit fucking sucks. Figure school will at least distract me.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can be a distraction too. Going to school now is-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday9.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve done your part already, okay? I mooch off you any longer and Chika won’t even be able to convince herself she’s “winning” anymore.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday10.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll pay you back for the room as soon as I can. But-",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday11.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...what?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday12.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just...I’ll pay you back as soon as I can. Maybe Noriko can ask the boss to give me an advance on my next paycheck or-",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t need to pay me back. Put it toward getting the power back on at Chika’s old place. I can help you pay the bill.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I already fuckin’ told you you’ve done enough.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": By spending one night with you and barely saying anything?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday13.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...hugged me and shit too...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And that helped?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Helped me...realize there’s still some shit out there scarier than cancer, yeah.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t go to school today.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday14.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You ain’t gonna talk me outta this, Sensei...but I...appreciate you looking after me.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just want to...try and get shit back to normal. Forget I read anything. Probably just...some kinda misunderstanding anyway.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or...we could talk about it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We do that too much now.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like...don’t you ever miss the days when I was just some fuckin’ delinquent you’d chase around on your quest to fuck every high school girl in Kumon-mi?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sometimes. But then I think about things like this and how, if we hadn’t ever become more, that you’d be all alone during the hardest times of your life.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You mean like what I’m tryin’ to do right now despite you practically beggin’ me to stay?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Exactly. Now sit back down or I’m going to come back to school for the sole purpose of making sure you have detention every day for the rest of your never-ending school life.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Never...ending...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday15.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait...yeah...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday16.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If we’re fuckin’ stuck here and shit, that means Yuki ain’t gonna go anywhere...right?! Her thing’ll just...reset! Back to normal! Right?!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday17.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right?...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know, Yumi.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday18.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The thing with Makoto’s dad is really the only example we have of death within the timeloops. And it’s not like we can just call him up to see if he’s alive again.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like...maybe if we get another call about him dying, we can assume things like that can happen. But without anything to go off of, we’ve just...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. Okay. I get it.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday19.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anyway, school. See you.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just like that? You’re not even wearing your uniform.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My-",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday20.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh, fuck. Forgot about that.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday21.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not exactly...used to spending the night in...seedy love hotels...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guess you have no choice but to skip school entirely then.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminextday22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminextday22.webp",
      "alt": "yuminextday22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s barely past five in the morning. I’ve got time to make it to the dorms and get changed beforehand.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I walk you there at least?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because walking out of a love hotel with a girl like me ain’t gonna be good for your public image. Nor would be walking me to the dorm while everyone else is getting ready.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You think I wanna be bombarded by questions right now, man? If I’m alone, people will just do what they always do and avoid me. That’s exactly what I need from everyone but you apparently.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not even going to tell Chika then? Because I feel like she’d be better at dealing with this sort of thing than literally anyone since she’s essentially gone through it already.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
